  "beats": [
    {
      "t": "2026-11-02T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "After a security incident on 29 October 2026, the site went down for maintenance first announced to last twelve hours, which was extended later that day to two to four weeks.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1383453548:21"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-02T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "Rebecca Tushnet, representing AO3, said that no data was lost during this incident.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1383453548:22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-02T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "Archive of Our Own, or AO3, is a nonprofit, open-source repository for fanfiction and other fanworks contributed by users.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1383453548:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-02T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "The site is run by the Organization for Transformative Works, which is based in Arlington County, United States.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q27764876:P137"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-02T00:00:33Z",
      "text": "The site was founded in 2008 and is owned by the Organization for Transformative Works.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q27764876:P571",
        "wd:Q27764876:P127"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-02T00:00:43Z",
      "text": "On 2 November 2026, the article drew 78,713 readers, about 57 times the usual figure of a median of 1,391 a day.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Archive_of_Our_Own:2026-11-02",
        "views:en:Archive_of_Our_Own:prior"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-02T00:00:50Z",
      "text": "The article was read in 11 languages, and after English, German had the most readers at 752.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Archive_of_Our_Own:2026-11-02",
        "views:de:Archive_of_Our_Own:2026-11-02"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-02T00:00:57Z",
      "text": "On the globe, each language glows where it is mainly spoken, brighter for more readers, and a language is not a country.",
      "cites": [
        "views:de:Archive_of_Our_Own:2026-11-02",
        "views:ru:Archive_of_Our_Own:2026-11-02",
        "views:fr:Archive_of_Our_Own:2026-11-02",
        "views:zh:AO3作品库:2026-11-02",
        "views:es:Archive_of_Our_Own:2026-11-02",
        "views:pt:Archive_of_Our_Own:2026-11-02"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-02T00:01:07Z",
      "text": "The sources are Wikipedia articles, Wikimedia pageviews and Wikidata, and each caption links to the evidence it rests on.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1383453548:21",
        "views:en:Archive_of_Our_Own:2026-11-02",
        "wd:Q27764876:P31"
      ]
    }
  ],
